{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Tedcx3ZEOxAC8O7cIz55XA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:11.017526+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Tedcx3ZEOxAC8O7cIz55XA","html":"<div><p><span><font><span><span>为进一步提高研究生生源质量，</span></span></font><font><span><span>2026年郑州大学</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>考古与文化遗产</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>学院计划接收推荐免试研究生。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>一、报名条件</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>凡已取得或预计可取得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生均可报名。我院将及时审核预报名申请信息，并根据考生填报信息及提交的材料，择优选择符合条件的考生进行复试。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>二、招收专业</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>学术型研究生</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><font><span><span>考古学</span></span></font><font><span><span>060100</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>专业型研究生</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><font><span><span>博物馆</span></span></font><font><span><span>065100</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><font><span><span>文物</span></span></font><font><span><span>165100</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>注：最终招生专业以研招网推免系统公布专业目录为准。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>三、材料提交要求</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>意向考生除填报预报名信息外，还需提交以下报名材料：</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>1.考生亲笔签名的《2026年郑州大学推免预报名申请表》（模板见附件一）；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>2.身份证正反面；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>3.加盖院系公章或学校教务部门公章的在校学习成绩单（前六个学期）；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>4.郑州大学研究生复试考生政审表（应届考生）（模板见附件二）；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>5.外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级考试，托福，雅思，PETS等证书或成绩单）；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>6.有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作等。（没有可不提供）；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>7.如在校期间从事课外科研活动中有突出表现的，提交由学校出具的证明材料（加盖教务处或学生处公章）。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>以上材料按顺序扫描成一个</span></span></font><font><span><span>PDF文档，并以“姓名-报考专业-联系方式”的方式命名，如：“张三-</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>考古学</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>-1</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>58</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>XXXXXXXX”，于2025年9月18日18:00前扫描下图二维码填写预报名信息并上传PDF文档</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>到指定邮箱</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>lxy2012292582@163.com。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hwY2cjPkBkiculaRvIN9cib3K9trlXGGXFl1w46NbUoojdEB1CSokIwicbk2fbajB8X6OkyYJOegic2bV5PX5Gxcqw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>四、面试工作安排</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>1.面试方式：线上面试。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>2.面试时间：按照中国研究生招生信息网系统报名时间确定。具体安排会在QQ群通知（群号：1029447804，申请进群请备注：推免本科学校+报考专业+姓名）。完成资料发送的同学请务必进群，进群后及时关注群通知。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>五、其他注意事项</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>1.全国推免服务系统（预计9月中下旬）开放后，已具有推免资格的考生，须在系统中注册并填报志愿，根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>2.咨询电话：0371-6</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>7781355</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>联系人：</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>刘</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>老师；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span></font><font><span><span>lxy2012292582@163.com</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Tedcx3ZEOxAC8O7cIz55XA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件一</a></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Tedcx3ZEOxAC8O7cIz55XA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件二</a></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>END</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>郑州大学考古与文化遗产学院官方微信公众号</span></span></font></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hwY2cjPkBkicHwNibgdytadYgsyLDWCh6r05wBYSCjkOQX7wr6PKfiaBdJS1ibwDuFd0ObD6GU5ERPNvibfxtdzF1qg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>初审 | 姬慧敏</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审 | 徐承向</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审 | 赵维娟</span></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"abc86468da9031e448a8caf2300a02d6badee70023b380e1bb3907942c872f5f","textLength":933,"sourceSha256":"4c474051b30d2ecb5cae40234a31361a1cfcb15cf3796bb3687107f181d22085","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-87541195473ffd394dbb","title":"2025年郑州大学考古与文化遗产学院关于2026年接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生预报名材料相关工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:11.017526+00:00"}
